細麵（200元）、柚雞白湯板腱牛中太麵（250元）跟唐揚雞（100元），結帳金額550元。\n\n結果我跟隊友吃了之後都發現比較喜歡對方的湯頭，索性吃了1/3就對換吃，板腱牛熟度剛剛好，白湯湯頭還算濃郁，黑蒜湯頭雖然有一些油脂但喝起來婆順口，可能因為有交換吃的關係，吃起來也都沒什麼膩感，個人覺得這個價位能吃吃到這樣的產品，CP值頗高。唐揚雞就算中規中矩，不會到乾柴，略有肉汁。\n\n以後有機會也會想再回訪，試試其他品項。",null,[0,62]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7894327743799417960/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFMVXhVUTNoUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7894327743799417960/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFMVXhVUTNoUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7894327743799417960/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFMVXhVUTNoUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7894327743799417960/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFMVXhVUTNoUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7894327743799417960/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFMVXhVUTNoUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7894327743799417960/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlFMVXhVUTNoUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,17268,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQLUxUQ3hRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x283079f905b05c52!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDP-LTCxQE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQLUxUQ3hRRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQLUxUQ3hRRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQLUxUQ0pREhNDZ3dJb2Ita3VnWVFzTFh2OUFJGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRFAtTFRDcFFFEhNDZ3dJb2Ita3VnWVFzTFh2OUFJIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARUlywBfl5MCgqCzBiSEd5V2lheGVr\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwik9cvpxdKWAxU2afUHHXdrAwIQoykI8gEoDw"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwiVsdHpxdKWAxX6eF4EHSFJFMYQ0pMFCJABKAc"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwik9cvpxdKWAxU2afUHHXdrAwIQ0pMFCNcBKAc"]],null,null,null,"other_user_google_review_po